  message: "Deferred from the ADR-0039 confidence-separation implementation (thread A). R5 Stage A (delete the fictional EVIDENCE_CONFIDENCE_MATRIX + withdraw the 0.30-default MUST) is done; the §12 prose was reconciled to reality in the R5 spec-honesty PR. Stage B remains: emit a per-evidence-type base_confidence table into spec §12 as a projection of evidence_types.EVIDENCE_TYPES (the concept-axes generated-docs pattern), with a --check freshness gate so the table can't drift from the registry. Lowest-value / most-infra piece of ADR-0039; deferred rather than hand-transcribing a drift-prone table."  # 2474
